    <data key="d0">Zigbang Hybrid Traffic Routing and Multi-Database Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0F7KDLz-kIQ</data>
    <data key="d2">Features an internal Route 53 dynamic weighted routing system governed by CloudWatch and AWS SDK feedback to balance load between ECS/Fargate and API Gateway/Lambda.</data>
